**/firebase-service-account.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
firebasedetails/
firebasedetails.zip
**/*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
backend/src/config/firebase-service-account.json
admission_hero_flutter/android/app/google-services.json
admission_hero_flutter/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

